       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for ibuprofen in adults is 3,200 mg/day by prescription.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg in one dose is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this level, the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot.\n\nWhich of these did you mean?\n\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily (3,200 mg/day).** This is the maximum for inflammatory conditions or severe pain.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours.** This is the usual range for mild to moderate pain.\n- **1600 mg total per day, such as 400 mg 4 times daily.** The intended number may have been the daily total.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that, and I'll add a note giving your rationale. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
